  "notes": "USAGE:\nA transitive ichidan verb. The passive form {裏付|うらづ}けられる is very common, meaning \"to be supported/backed by evidence.\" The related noun is {裏付|うらづ}け (supporting evidence, substantiation).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {証拠|しょうこ}で{裏付|うらづ}ける: to substantiate with evidence\n- データに{裏付|うらづ}けられた: backed by data\n- {裏付|うらづ}けを{取|と}る: to obtain corroboration\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {裏付|うらづ}け (noun): supporting evidence, substantiation",
